mxCell id="prk-dcd5-evs-rtl-l0" value="1" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-dcd5-evs-rtl"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-dcd5-evs-rtl-l1" value="rtl_ids 1..*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-dcd5-evs-rtl"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-dcd5-mon-srv" value="" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.85;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prk-dcd5-mon" target="prk-dcd5-srv"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-dcd5-mon-srv-l1" value="get_kriteria()" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-dcd5-mon-srv"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-dcd5-n0" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, §13.6; CLAUDE.md bagian 5)&lt;br&gt;• Ungu «AbstractModel» (nama miring) = &lt;i&gt;mixin&lt;/i&gt; tanpa tabel; segitiga kosong ungu = &lt;code&gt;_inherit = [mixin, …]&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• «Odoo» abu-abu = model bawaan; «Core» / «SDM» abu-abu putus-putus = model addon lain yang dipakai. Tepi merah = model hasil desain tanpa padanan 1:1 di CM. Segitiga merah putus-putus = &lt;code&gt;_inherit&lt;/code&gt; tanpa &lt;code&gt;_name&lt;/code&gt; baru (perluasan model milik addon lain).&lt;br&gt;• Panah terbuka = Many2one/Many2many berarah, label = nama field + multiplisitas. Belah ketupat hitam = One2many + Many2one (anak ikut terhapus). Putus-putus = field/rujukan &lt;code&gt;compute&lt;/code&gt; atau pemanggilan method.&lt;br&gt;• Atribut bertipe hanya untuk model bawaan Odoo (hr.employee, ir.attachment, survey.*). Field warisan mixin tidak ditulis ulang.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;+&lt;/code&gt; publik (&lt;code&gt;action_*&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;get_*&lt;/code&gt;), &lt;code&gt;#&lt;/code&gt; internal (&lt;code&gt;_…&lt;/code&gt;), @model, @constrains, «override», {abstract}, {hook}. (O) = lapis Pelengkap." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="687" width="760" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-dcd5-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Kunci&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Survei &lt;b&gt;memperluas&lt;/b&gt; addon &lt;code&gt;survey&lt;/code&gt; (LGPL-3), tidak membuat model survei sendiri: Respons dan Jawaban CM = &lt;code&gt;survey.user_input&lt;/code&gt; dan &lt;code&gt;.line&lt;/code&gt; bawaan; jumlah responden = &lt;code&gt;answer_done_count&lt;/code&gt; bawaan. Anonim lewat &lt;code&gt;access_mode&lt;/code&gt; publik (AB-PRK-28).&lt;br&gt;• PenetapanSurvei (kejadian) → &lt;code&gt;penetap_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;tanggal_tetap&lt;/code&gt;; wewenang dicek &lt;code&gt;penetap.job_id.punya_wewenang('mengesahkan', 'survei_kepuasan')&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;code&gt;status_lab&lt;/code&gt; tersimpan supaya bisa dipakai filter; nilainya dihitung dari penetapan, evaluasi, dan RTL (§9.3.2 CM).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;labfik.praktikum.monev.get_status()&lt;/code&gt; mendelegasikan ke &lt;code&gt;sesi.get_cek_monev(pkg)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;penilaian.berbukti&lt;/code&gt;, dan &lt;code&gt;survey.get_kriteria()&lt;/code&gt; (delegasi, §13.5)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="687" width="760" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-dcd5-n2" value="Design class diagram (masuk proposal Bab II 2.3). Diturunkan dari conceptual model CM-1–4, katalog operasi SSD, AB-PRK-01–34, kontrak Core 16 Nov 2026. Rincian: rancangan/design-class-praktikum.md · Draf 16 Nov 2026 · Herrens" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="877" width="1540" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>